Package: timberSupply
Type: Package
Title: Timber Supply on LandR Landscapes
Description: Tools for the questions a Timber Supply Review asks of a LandR
    forest landscape: where harvest can happen (timber harvesting land base and
    harvest constraints), how long between cuts (rotation age), how much (annual
    allowable cut), what is cut, and what it yields (merchantable oven-dry tonnes).
URL: https://github.com/PredictiveEcology/timberSupply
BugReports: https://github.com/PredictiveEcology/timberSupply/issues
Version: 0.0.0.9000
